{{!
    Mobile bottom navigation — Phase B0 Player iter 5 (2026-05-14)

    Fixed-position bottom-bar nav visible only on mobile (<590px).
    Manifesto §4.1 — primary destinations always one tap away.

    Four destinations:
      Home       /my/dashboard.php
      My Learning /local/airpay_catalog/mycourses.php
      Search     /local/airpay_catalog/index.php
      Me         /user/profile.php (own profile)

    Context:
        homeurl        (required)
        mycoursesurl   (required)
        searchurl      (required)
        profileurl     (required)
        active_route   (optional) — "home" | "mylearning" | "search" | "me"
                                    — drives aria-current="page" on the
                                    matching item

    A11y:
      - <nav> landmark with aria-label
      - Each item is a button-shaped <a> with min-height 56px (well
        above 44pt) and clear label below icon
      - aria-current="page" reflects active route
      - Decorative icons aria-hidden

    Visibility:
      Display: none on tablet+ via CSS media query in
      _course-player.scss (extracted there to keep the partial pure HTML).
}}
<nav class="airpay-mobile-nav" aria-label="Primary mobile navigation">
    <a href="{{homeurl}}"
       class="airpay-mobile-nav__item"
       {{#is_home}}aria-current="page"{{/is_home}}>
        <i class="fa fa-home airpay-mobile-nav__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="airpay-mobile-nav__label">Home</span>
    </a>
    <a href="{{mycoursesurl}}"
       class="airpay-mobile-nav__item"
       {{#is_mylearning}}aria-current="page"{{/is_mylearning}}>
        <i class="fa fa-graduation-cap airpay-mobile-nav__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="airpay-mobile-nav__label">My Learning</span>
    </a>
    <a href="{{searchurl}}"
       class="airpay-mobile-nav__item"
       {{#is_search}}aria-current="page"{{/is_search}}>
        <i class="fa fa-search airpay-mobile-nav__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="airpay-mobile-nav__label">Search</span>
    </a>
    <a href="{{profileurl}}"
       class="airpay-mobile-nav__item"
       {{#is_me}}aria-current="page"{{/is_me}}>
        <i class="fa fa-user-circle airpay-mobile-nav__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="airpay-mobile-nav__label">Me</span>
    </a>
</nav>
